1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,984
She complains to Gaston that the friend tires her frightfully.

2
00:00:03,984 --> 00:00:07,330
Gaston is puzzled: the man gives her no trouble.

3
00:00:07,330 --> 00:00:13,684
I should like him better if he did, she answers, a reply that gives away more than she knows.

4
00:00:13,684 --> 00:00:17,005
She announces she will go to the city in the morning.

